  when level<51.3
  tip Top up to level 51.3 on the Spitelash Myrmidons (50-51) of the ruins between Sanath's camp and the north: the blood elves at Kim'jael's camp are 51-53. Or, with a group, run the Sunken Temple dungeon instead.
  goto 46.5,54.5 map 1447 "Spitelash Myrmidon"
