step Blasted Lands: kill these as you meet them
  zone Blasted Lands
  tip Ride back south into the Blasted Lands for the bloodmages' beasts: Starving Snickerfangs roam the dry hills south of the bloodmages' camp, Scorpok Stingers scuttle across the middle of the north and Black Slayer vultures circle over all of it. Ashmane Boars and Redstone Basilisks share the slopes south-west of the keep.
  tip Careful: two elites roam here: Calefactus the Unleashed (50) in the middle of the zone around 44,34, and Vek'zol (55) on the ridge around 39,32. When you see one, hunt somewhere else.
  collect 8396 quest 2585
