step Kum'isha the Collector
  tip Kum'isha waits at the Rise of the Defiler, the hill south-west of the keep. The Blasted Lands mobs on the way drop the Imperfect Draenethyst Fragments; bring her what you have. Come at her hill straight from the keep, along the road, and leave by the same way.
  tip Careful: Felcular, Razelikh the Defiler and Ilifar are all level 60 elites. Razelikh casts Mana Burn, Strong Cleave and Decimate, and as its health drops it adds Razelikh's Tear, Flames of Chaos and then Enrage at 15%.
  tip Careful: Vek'zol, a level 55 elite, stands by Kum'isha's hill (about 50,35) and to the west (about 39,32), and the Dreadmaul and Shadowsworn camps around it are 53-55: take the fragments from the mobs on the way from the keep, not beside him.
  accept 3501                         -- Kum'isha the Collector walks around here: look inside the circle on the map
  collect 10593 quest 3501.1
  turnin 3501

